  draw:['DRAW YOUR TAXI','Tap the original <strong>空車 / VACANT sign</strong>. It flips 90° to draw a taxi. This is your <strong>one roll for this turn</strong>. A failed draw passes immediately. A valid taxi appears at the pick-up and waits for your next turn to drive.',''],
  roll:['TAP 空車 / VACANT','Tap the <strong>空車 / VACANT sign</strong> to flip it 90° and roll 1–6 movement steps.',''],
  bonusroll:['EXTRA 空車 / VACANT TAP','Your saved card roll is ready. Tap <strong>空車 / VACANT once</strong> for this turn. The next-base-roll penalty remains saved.',''],
  move:['DRIVING · 載客',`<strong>${s.remaining} steps left.</strong> Move one connected dot at a time. Finish these steps and the landing event, then pass to the next driver.`,''],
